			<div class="content" id="post-content-4822784">
									

<p>For me, the ending is just disastrously campy. I can tolerate a good bit of silliness in a skip, but this just seems like it comes out and says way too much about the anomaly. It's literally a villainous monologue. That being said, I really like each of the previous logs. I'm actually going to agree with Scorpion451 that I think the problem is the length of the buildup- If the article was longer and began in a more subtle way, I think the ending would land more for me.</p>
<p>Novote.</p>

